---
layout: base.njk
title: "Home"
nav: "home"
description: "Morgan and Allie, two sisters with celiac disease, share celiac-safe restaurants across Chicago & Chicagoland, gluten-free recipes, product picks, and living well with celiac."
---
{% set featuredRestaurants = collections.featuredRestaurants %}
{% set latestIssue = collections.newsletterIssues[0] %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Chicago &amp; Chicagoland</span>
      <h1>Two sisters, one celiac journey, a whole lot of safe eating.</h1>
      <p class="lead">We're Morgan &amp; Allie — sisters navigating life with celiac disease. We test the restaurants, read the labels, and cook the recipes so you can eat out (and eat well) without the worry.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/restaurants/" class="btn btn-primary">Find a Safe Restaurant</a>
        <a href="/about/" class="btn btn-outline">Read Our Story</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="photo-placeholder">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="10.5" r="1.5"/><path d="M21 15l-5-5-9 9"/></svg>
      <div class="ph-label">Photo: Morgan &amp; Allie</div>
      <div class="ph-sub">Swap this for a real photo anytime — just send it over</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="icon-wrap"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 11l9-8 9 8"/><path d="M5 10v10h14V10"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem;">Restaurants Vetted</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;">From dedicated gluten-free kitchens to spots with real celiac protocols — Chicagoland, mapped out.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="icon-wrap"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem;">Real, Tested Recipes</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;">Naturally gluten-free and celiac-safe meals we actually cook at home, from breakfast to dessert.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="icon-wrap"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 2l3 6 7 1-5 5 1 7-6-3-6 3 1-7-5-5 7-1z"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem;">No-Nonsense Newsletter</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;">Cross-contamination tips, label-reading know-how, and new spots — straight to your inbox.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Fresh off the list</span>
    <h2>Where we're eating this month</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:30px;">A few of our current favorites for guaranteed peace of mind.</p>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {% for r in featuredRestaurants %}
      <div class="card">
        {% if r.data.photo %}<img class="card-photo" src="{{ r.data.photo }}" alt="{{ r.data.title }}">{% endif %}
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="tag {% if r.data.category == 'Dedicated' %}tag-dedicated{% else %}tag-friendly{% endif %}">{% if r.data.category == 'Dedicated' %}100% Dedicated GF{% else %}Extensive GF Menu{% endif %}</span>
          <h3>{{ r.data.title }}</h3>
          <p class="meta-line">{{ r.data.neighborhood }}{% if r.data.address %} · {{ r.data.address }}{% endif %}</p>
          {{ r.templateContent | safe }}
          <a href="/restaurants/#{{ r.data.category | lower }}">See full write-up &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if latestIssue %}
<section class="section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-2" style="align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Latest Newsletter</span>
        <h2>Issue No. {{ latestIssue.data.issue_number }}: {{ latestIssue.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ latestIssue.data.summary }}</p>
        <a href="{{ latestIssue.url }}" class="btn btn-primary">Read Issue No. {{ latestIssue.data.issue_number }}</a>
      </div>
      {% if latestIssue.data.cover_image %}
      <img src="{{ latestIssue.data.cover_image }}" alt="{{ latestIssue.data.title }}" style="border-radius:14px; width:100%; height:220px; object-fit:cover;">
      {% else %}
      <div class="photo-placeholder" style="min-height:220px;">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 4h16v16H4z"/><path d="M4 8h16"/><path d="M8 4v4"/></svg>
        <div class="ph-label">Newsletter cover graphic</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="signup-box">
      <h2>Get the newsletter</h2>
      <p>One email, a few times a month. New restaurants, recipes, and the label-reading tips that keep us safe.</p>
      <form class="signup-form" name="newsletter" method="POST" data-netlify="true">
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="newsletter">
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@email.com" required>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-coral">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
